              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Account (447) differs from page 397 because it includes other transmission revenue. Page 397 excludes other transmission revenues. Those revenues are unbundled and are shown as a separate line item on page 397.</span>
